# Build context is kalshi-trader/ (Dockerfile, run.sh, app/). Same secret exclusions as .gitignore
# (SPEC.md §10 Secrets), at any depth, plus local build output and docs (`*.md` except DOCS.md).
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/config.local.json
**/*.db*
**/.local/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.md
!DOCS.md
